  Q1  Where should the session store live?

❯ A ○ SQLite in the checkout
      One file, no service to run, and it can be deleted with the checkout.
  B ○ Postgres beside the app
      Shared between machines, and one more service to keep running.
  C ○ The OS keyring
      Nothing to back up, where the host has one.
